Photofield is a fast, self-hosted, single-binary photo gallery with a
focus on speed: EXIF-timeline layout (Google-Photos-like feed), no ML,
read-only over an existing photo tree.

hlab build notes: UI (npm/vite) built at port build time and embedded
via -tags embedui; go deps vendored by the framework from the module
cache (offline build). Runs as user _p2p on :8085, no auth (LAN-only).
